        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kalung rianra pui ram jaona,",
            "Poubaumei nim pui bam;",
            "Getsemani pikuan lung lung khou,",
            "Talan jei hang @&4 luang.",
            "",
            "2. Simon Johan bauliangmei pu,",
            "Kathei lai ngam mak ge;",
            "Kanloumei puta jai kan the,",
            "Amuh daimei kai khou.",
            "",
            "3. Sao pirun le phei hang banna,",
            "Buih @&4 katum lou na;",
            "Thou cho? Baimei hei sapat ro,",
            "Tuna kata nu the.",
            "",
            "4. Apoubaumei rianramei hei,",
            "Akhang khangh lou kan the;",
            "Nuan phungmei nun khang runlou mak,",
            "Nang guang pirun la khang.",
            "",
            "",
            "Favourite song: Mrs. Asing Gangmei"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
